1
00:00:01,084 --> 00:00:04,129
<i>I couldn't find anything</i>
<i>about Bea's father.</i>

2
00:00:04,212 --> 00:00:07,257
<i>Thank you for taking the time</i>
<i>to look for Bea's father.</i>

3
00:00:07,340 --> 00:00:09,009
<i>And don't worry.</i>

4
00:00:09,092 --> 00:00:11,553
<i>I already have a plan for Bea and Caloy.</i>

5
00:00:11,636 --> 00:00:14,973
<i>- So? How does it look?</i>
- [CHARM] <i>Wow, it's so pretty!</i>

6
00:00:15,056 --> 00:00:18,309
<i>- It's so pretty, right?</i>
<i>- Definitely worth 30 million!</i>

7
00:00:18,393 --> 00:00:21,813
<i>Keep your eyes on it later, okay?</i>
<i>We can't afford to lose it.</i>

8
00:00:21,896 --> 00:00:24,566
<i>You know, guys,</i>
<i>I think we should get some coffee.</i>

9
00:00:24,649 --> 00:00:25,775
<i>The event isn't until later.</i>

10
00:00:25,859 --> 00:00:27,277
[MARJ] <i>What about the necklace?</i>

11
00:00:27,360 --> 00:00:28,611
[BILLY] <i>I got it.</i>

12
00:00:29,988 --> 00:00:36,995
[TENSE MUSIC PLAYING]

13
00:00:42,417 --> 00:00:44,669
<i>We hit the jackpot with this!</i>

14
00:00:44,753 --> 00:00:46,212
<i>But more importantly,</i>

15
00:00:46,296 --> 00:00:49,257
<i>this will be a huge blow to Billy!</i>

16
00:00:50,383 --> 00:00:51,509
<i>Okay.</i>

17
00:00:52,343 --> 00:00:54,846
<i>Just tell me when and where.</i>

18
00:00:55,430 --> 00:00:58,850
<i>I'll do anything for you.</i>

19
00:00:58,933 --> 00:01:05,648
[SUSPENSEFUL MUSIC PLAYING]

20
00:01:18,828 --> 00:01:20,622
[JORDAN, CALOY GRUNTING]

21
00:01:20,705 --> 00:01:21,831
<i>- Dude!</i>
<i>- Get off me!</i>

22
00:01:23,083 --> 00:01:24,375
- [PEPPER SPRAY HISSES]
- [SCREAMS]

23
00:01:24,459 --> 00:01:25,960
<i>Jordan! The necklace!</i>

24
00:01:26,628 --> 00:01:28,379
<i>- Go, go, go!</i>
<i>- Run!</i>

25
00:01:29,506 --> 00:01:30,715
- [CALOY] <i>Get back here!</i>
<i>- Go!</i>

26
00:01:30,799 --> 00:01:32,175
<i>I'll kill both of you!</i>

27
00:01:32,258 --> 00:01:33,802
<i>- Jordan, let's go!</i>
<i>- Give me the necklace!</i>

28
00:01:33,885 --> 00:01:35,804
- [CALOY GRUNTS]
- [JORDAN] <i>Stay back. Dude.</i>

29
00:01:37,472 --> 00:01:39,307
<i>Give me back the necklace,</i>
<i>or I'll kill you.</i>

30
00:01:40,141 --> 00:01:42,352
<i>- </i>[CALOY GROANS]
<i>- Hands in the air!</i>

31
00:01:42,435 --> 00:01:43,728
<i>No sudden movements!</i>

32
00:01:43,812 --> 00:01:46,523
<i>Cuff him!</i>
<i>Don't make any sudden movements.</i>

33
00:01:48,608 --> 00:01:50,151
<i>Ms. Beatrice Mercado?</i>

34
00:01:52,904 --> 00:01:55,073
<i>You need to come with us</i>
<i>to the police station now.</i>

35
00:01:55,156 --> 00:02:01,371
[SUSPENSEFUL MUSIC CONTINUES]

36
00:02:08,253 --> 00:02:10,338
[TALIA] <i>Well, your plan worked.</i>

37
00:02:11,047 --> 00:02:13,091
Because of you, Ms. Talia.

38
00:02:14,759 --> 00:02:18,304
[TALIA] <i>I am not considering</i>
<i>Bea Mercado for the position,</i>

39
00:02:18,388 --> 00:02:20,265
<i>especially with her track record.</i>

40
00:02:20,348 --> 00:02:21,975
<i>- Mm-hmm.</i>
<i>- But…</i>

41
00:02:22,058 --> 00:02:24,727
<i>when I found out that her</i>
<i>case is involved with you,</i>

42
00:02:24,811 --> 00:02:26,062
<i>I called you.</i>

43
00:02:26,688 --> 00:02:28,231
<i>I'm worried about you, Billy.</i>

44
00:02:29,732 --> 00:02:31,317
<i>Thank you, Ms. Talia.</i>

45
00:02:31,401 --> 00:02:34,529
<i>She says the accusations</i>
<i>against her are not true.</i>

46
00:02:35,113 --> 00:02:36,573
<i>- Mm.</i>
<i>- So…</i>

47
00:02:36,656 --> 00:02:38,992
<i>I wanted to get your side of the story.</i>

48
00:02:42,287 --> 00:02:44,998
<i>There's only one thing</i>
<i>you need to know, Ms. Talia.</i>

49
00:02:46,791 --> 00:02:49,711
<i>You can't trust Bea Mercado.</i>

50
00:02:51,546 --> 00:02:53,131
<i>And I can prove that.</i>

51
00:02:54,048 --> 00:02:55,133
<i>How?</i>

52
00:02:59,888 --> 00:03:01,598
<i>I'll be needing your help.</i>

53
00:03:01,681 --> 00:03:05,310
[MYSTERIOUS MUSIC PLAYING]

54
00:03:05,393 --> 00:03:07,770
<i>Ever since we rolled out this campaign,</i>

55
00:03:07,854 --> 00:03:10,148
<i>there has been an increase in</i>
<i>the number of our followers.</i>

56
00:03:10,231 --> 00:03:12,984
<i>And of course, this translates into</i>

57
00:03:13,067 --> 00:03:14,277
<i>sales!</i>

58
00:03:14,360 --> 00:03:16,779
<i>So we are continuing this campaign</i>

59
00:03:16,863 --> 00:03:19,365
<i>with our next partner,</i>

60
00:03:20,033 --> 00:03:23,036
<i>Billy Cariño of LoveList.</i>

61
00:03:23,870 --> 00:03:27,248
<i>She is the perfect next partner for us.</i>

62
00:03:27,332 --> 00:03:30,126
<i>More than just having a big following</i>
<i>and being a businesswoman,</i>

63
00:03:30,209 --> 00:03:32,253
<i>she is relevant.</i>

64
00:03:32,337 --> 00:03:34,797
[BEA] <i>We hit the jackpot with this!</i>

65
00:03:34,881 --> 00:03:36,382
<i>But more importantly,</i>

66
00:03:36,466 --> 00:03:39,260
<i>this will be a huge blow to Billy!</i>

67
00:03:39,344 --> 00:03:42,222
Good thing she took the bait.

68
00:03:42,847 --> 00:03:43,890
Thank you.

69
00:03:43,973 --> 00:03:46,100
Billy, anything for you.

70
00:03:46,184 --> 00:03:49,687
In fact, I should be the one to thank you.

71
00:03:49,771 --> 00:03:52,232
You know that I almost gave up on love.

72
00:03:52,315 --> 00:03:56,778
<i>I thought it was too late</i>
<i>for me to find someone.</i>

73
00:03:56,861 --> 00:04:00,823
If not for LoveList and you,

74
00:04:00,907 --> 00:04:04,577
maybe I would not have found my forever.

75
00:04:04,661 --> 00:04:05,495
So…

76
00:04:05,578 --> 00:04:07,580
thank you very much.

77
00:04:07,664 --> 00:04:09,040
I have to go.

78
00:04:14,379 --> 00:04:16,256
Happy anniversary, my love.

79
00:04:16,339 --> 00:04:18,216
[GASPS] They're beautiful.

80
00:04:18,299 --> 00:04:19,259
Of course.

81
00:04:20,677 --> 00:04:22,095
Thank you.

82
00:04:30,186 --> 00:04:31,271
Okay.

83
00:04:38,653 --> 00:04:44,784
[UPLIFTING MUSIC PLAYING]

84
00:04:54,919 --> 00:05:01,634
[THEME MUSIC PLAYING]

85
00:05:39,130 --> 00:05:46,137
[GUITAR STRUMMING]

86
00:05:53,311 --> 00:05:56,981
I can't believe she didn't involve us
in the plan.

87
00:05:57,065 --> 00:05:59,108
We missed the exciting part.

88
00:05:59,192 --> 00:06:01,152
I get it.

89
00:06:01,235 --> 00:06:05,323
It would have been risky
if she'd told us the plan, right?

90
00:06:05,406 --> 00:06:07,492
What if we'd all been nervous

91
00:06:07,575 --> 00:06:10,703
and the plan had failed?

92
00:06:10,787 --> 00:06:13,539
It's a good thing he was caught.

93
00:06:14,165 --> 00:06:16,125
But still, it's a shame, isn't it?

94
00:06:16,667 --> 00:06:18,711
I mean, imagine the suspense

95
00:06:18,795 --> 00:06:21,589
and the contents we could have
made out of it, right?

96
00:06:23,633 --> 00:06:28,805
<i>♪ Even in the silence ♪</i>

97
00:06:28,888 --> 00:06:31,349
<i>♪ You're the only one ♪</i>

98
00:06:31,432 --> 00:06:35,144
- [MOUTHS SILENTLY] She's not here yet.
<i>- ♪ On my mind ♪</i>

99
00:06:35,228 --> 00:06:38,564
<i>♪ Can we take a rest? ♪</i>

100
00:06:38,648 --> 00:06:41,567
<i>♪ I might say something I'll regret ♪</i>

101
00:06:42,527 --> 00:06:47,323
<i>♪ Baby, I won't be long ♪</i>

102
00:06:49,242 --> 00:06:55,665
<i>♪ You matter more to me than being right ♪</i>

103
00:06:56,249 --> 00:07:01,045
<i>♪ Baby, I won't be long ♪</i>

104
00:07:01,129 --> 00:07:04,966
<i>♪ I'll be back by the end of the song ♪</i>

105
00:07:08,052 --> 00:07:14,016
[BRIGHT MUSIC PLAYING]

106
00:07:29,949 --> 00:07:35,121
[BRIGHT MUSIC CONTINUES]

107
00:07:48,134 --> 00:07:51,637
<i>♪ Oh ♪</i>

108
00:07:53,014 --> 00:07:58,352
<i>♪ Even in the silence ♪</i>

109
00:07:58,436 --> 00:08:05,151
<i>♪ You're the only one</i>
<i>On my mind ♪</i>

110
00:08:06,903 --> 00:08:11,949
<i>♪ Even in the silence ♪</i>

111
00:08:12,033 --> 00:08:18,873
<i>♪ You're the only one</i>
<i>On my mind ♪</i>

112
00:08:18,956 --> 00:08:22,668
<i>♪ Yeah ♪</i>

113
00:08:23,252 --> 00:08:26,631
<i>♪ Mmm ♪</i>

114
00:08:28,257 --> 00:08:31,719
<i>♪ I won't be long ♪</i>

115
00:08:31,802 --> 00:08:35,848
<i>♪ I'll be back by the end of the song ♪</i>

116
00:08:35,932 --> 00:08:42,730
- [UPLIFTING MUSIC PLAYING]
- [PEOPLE APPLAUDING]

117
00:08:46,150 --> 00:08:49,946
Our next awardee is not just
the CEO of LoveList,

118
00:08:50,029 --> 00:08:52,323
but the heart behind its success.

119
00:08:52,406 --> 00:08:54,659
Please join me as we celebrate

120
00:08:54,742 --> 00:08:58,538
one of today's
Young Entrepreneurial awardees,

121
00:08:58,621 --> 00:09:02,333
the visionary who leads
with brilliance and heart,

122
00:09:02,416 --> 00:09:04,794
Ms. Benilda Cariño.

123
00:09:04,877 --> 00:09:09,715
[PEOPLE APPLAUDING]

124
00:09:15,680 --> 00:09:17,974
[NO AUDIBLE DIALOG]

125
00:09:28,109 --> 00:09:29,485
Good evening.

126
00:09:30,945 --> 00:09:32,363
A few years ago,

127
00:09:32,446 --> 00:09:38,786
my friends and I were just talking
about love, heartbreak,

128
00:09:39,704 --> 00:09:42,164
and finding the courage to start again.

129
00:09:42,248 --> 00:09:46,460
And from those honest
late-night conversations,

130
00:09:47,169 --> 00:09:49,005
LoveList was born.

131
00:09:49,088 --> 00:09:51,215
Only my name is written here,

132
00:09:51,299 --> 00:09:54,343
but LoveList was never built alone.

133
00:09:55,303 --> 00:09:58,472
LoveList stands where it is today

134
00:09:58,556 --> 00:10:00,808
because of my team,

135
00:10:00,891 --> 00:10:02,518
my best friend,

136
00:10:03,102 --> 00:10:04,645
my LoveList family,

137
00:10:05,813 --> 00:10:07,398
and my family.

138
00:10:09,358 --> 00:10:12,486
They believed in our vision,

139
00:10:13,154 --> 00:10:17,033
long before there was any proof
that it would work.

140
00:10:18,826 --> 00:10:21,370
So, to our partners,

141
00:10:22,121 --> 00:10:25,791
thank you for helping us
create a safe space

142
00:10:25,875 --> 00:10:27,585
for online dating.

143
00:10:27,668 --> 00:10:30,379
And to our LoveListers,

144
00:10:30,463 --> 00:10:35,676
thank you so much for entrusting
your hearts to us.

145
00:10:37,428 --> 00:10:41,057
I promise, from here on,
it only gets better.

146
00:10:41,140 --> 00:10:44,310
Because every Filipina
deserves to feel safe

147
00:10:44,393 --> 00:10:46,729
and empowered in love.

148
00:10:46,812 --> 00:10:49,523
Again, thank you very much.

149
00:10:49,607 --> 00:10:55,446
[CROWD APPLAUDING]

150
00:11:08,209 --> 00:11:09,460
- [DOOR OPENING]
- [OFFICER] Get in.

151
00:11:12,380 --> 00:11:15,257
[UNSETTLING MUSIC PLAYING]

152
00:11:20,971 --> 00:11:25,518
[UNSETTLING MUSIC CONTINUES]

153
00:11:25,601 --> 00:11:26,936
'Bi, you know what?

154
00:11:27,019 --> 00:11:28,062
What a waste.

155
00:11:28,938 --> 00:11:30,856
I had the jewelry already.

156
00:11:30,940 --> 00:11:32,817
We could've been rich, my love.

157
00:11:34,360 --> 00:11:36,654
And you could've gotten
your revenge on Billy.

158
00:11:36,737 --> 00:11:38,948
Isn't that what you want?

159
00:11:39,990 --> 00:11:42,118
I don't care about Billy.

160
00:11:42,201 --> 00:11:43,119
All right?

161
00:11:43,202 --> 00:11:45,329
Leave me alone.
"My love, my love."

162
00:11:45,413 --> 00:11:46,914
I don't care about that Billy.

163
00:11:46,997 --> 00:11:49,458
And most importantly,
I don't care about you.

164
00:11:51,085 --> 00:11:52,294
[CALOY EXHALES SOFTLY]

165
00:11:52,378 --> 00:11:53,963
'Bi, don't say that.

166
00:11:54,547 --> 00:11:55,965
Don't touch me.

167
00:11:59,969 --> 00:12:01,053
Please.

168
00:12:02,263 --> 00:12:03,764
Please, I'm begging you.

169
00:12:05,433 --> 00:12:07,143
Please, just leave me alone.

170
00:12:07,226 --> 00:12:08,227
Okay?

171
00:12:08,310 --> 00:12:09,603
Please.

172
00:12:10,312 --> 00:12:13,274
Do you know I'm getting
in trouble because of you?

173
00:12:13,357 --> 00:12:14,984
Because of what you've been doing.

174
00:12:15,067 --> 00:12:16,861
Because you refuse to leave me alone.

175
00:12:16,944 --> 00:12:20,072
So please, okay? Just leave me alone.

176
00:12:20,156 --> 00:12:21,782
Because they think

177
00:12:21,866 --> 00:12:23,409
we're accomplices.

178
00:12:23,492 --> 00:12:24,869
[TENSE MUSIC PLAYING]

179
00:12:24,952 --> 00:12:26,787
I could even go to jail because of you.

180
00:12:26,871 --> 00:12:28,998
So please, I'm begging you.

181
00:12:29,081 --> 00:12:32,334
Please, please. Stay away from me.

182
00:12:32,418 --> 00:12:36,881
[TENSE MUSIC CONTINUES]

183
00:12:36,964 --> 00:12:39,633
[CALOY LAUGHING]

184
00:12:39,717 --> 00:12:42,636
Accomplices?! You got that right!
We're accomplices!

185
00:12:42,720 --> 00:12:44,597
Accomplices in love, right?

186
00:12:45,222 --> 00:12:47,099
That's how we do it.

187
00:12:47,183 --> 00:12:48,976
'Bi, you know I'm right.

188
00:12:49,059 --> 00:12:50,769
You love me. I know you do.

189
00:12:51,353 --> 00:12:52,855
'Bi, come on.

190
00:12:52,938 --> 00:12:54,273
That's how we do it…

191
00:12:54,899 --> 00:12:56,901
- Crazy! You're crazy!
- [CALOY] That's how, right?

192
00:12:56,984 --> 00:12:58,444
- No!
- [BEA] See, ma'am? He's crazy!

193
00:12:58,527 --> 00:13:00,154
What do you mean, "crazy?!"
I'm not crazy, 'Bi!

194
00:13:00,237 --> 00:13:02,573
- What I'm saying is true.
- [BEA] We only met once!

195
00:13:02,656 --> 00:13:05,534
It was just karaoke! Just one duet!

196
00:13:05,618 --> 00:13:06,827
And now you're harassing me?

197
00:13:06,911 --> 00:13:08,704
I'm going to get arrested because of you?!

198
00:13:08,787 --> 00:13:10,080
'Bi, what do you mean, harassing you?

199
00:13:10,915 --> 00:13:13,000
What I feel is real. You know that, 'Bi.

200
00:13:13,083 --> 00:13:14,585
You love me. I know you do!

201
00:13:14,668 --> 00:13:16,545
- I'm right, aren't I?
- [BEA] I don't--

202
00:13:16,629 --> 00:13:17,796
What do you mean, "love?!"

203
00:13:17,880 --> 00:13:20,633
How can I love you?! We only met once!

204
00:13:20,716 --> 00:13:24,762
Why do we even have to know each other
when it's true that we love each other?

205
00:13:24,845 --> 00:13:26,889
'Bi, I love you!

206
00:13:26,972 --> 00:13:28,474
- [BEA] Please.
- You know, when I get out--

207
00:13:28,557 --> 00:13:30,476
When I escape, we'll be together.

208
00:13:30,559 --> 00:13:31,519
We'll get rich, 'Bi.

209
00:13:31,602 --> 00:13:33,687
We'll become rich, 'Bi.

210
00:13:33,771 --> 00:13:35,272
[SUSPENSEFUL MUSIC PLAYING]

211
00:13:35,356 --> 00:13:36,607
[CALOY] 'Bi, I love you!

212
00:13:36,690 --> 00:13:40,778
[SUSPENSEFUL MUSIC CONTINUES, FADES]

213
00:13:40,861 --> 00:13:43,614
[BILLY] Girls, congrats!

214
00:13:43,697 --> 00:13:45,658
- [CHARM] Congrats!
- [BILLY] Congrats, everyone!

215
00:13:45,741 --> 00:13:47,117
[TONI] Congrats! Kiss. Mwah!

216
00:13:47,201 --> 00:13:48,619
- [TONI] Deserved!
- Congratulations!

217
00:13:48,702 --> 00:13:50,704
- Thank you. Thank you!
- [VALERIE] Congrats.

218
00:13:50,788 --> 00:13:52,081
[MARJ] Chief.

219
00:13:52,164 --> 00:13:53,624
- Wow.
- [MARJ] Let's drink.

220
00:13:53,707 --> 00:13:54,583
Cheers?

221
00:13:54,667 --> 00:13:57,461
- [MARJ] Cheers to our chief!
- [ALL CHEERING]

222
00:13:57,545 --> 00:13:58,963
- [CHARM] Whoo!
- [TONI] You were so good!

223
00:13:59,046 --> 00:14:00,381
[BILLY] That also goes for you.

224
00:14:00,464 --> 00:14:03,842
Billy, give me a soundbite for my vlog.

225
00:14:03,926 --> 00:14:05,886
After LoveLine,

226
00:14:05,970 --> 00:14:08,847
Happily Ever After, and now this award,

227
00:14:08,931 --> 00:14:12,101
what's next for the Billy Cariño
and LoveList?

228
00:14:12,184 --> 00:14:14,103
Wow, what's next?

229
00:14:14,186 --> 00:14:17,481
Well, I'm always reading
the comments about us,

230
00:14:17,565 --> 00:14:23,070
and I noticed our supporters aren't
just here in the Philippines.

231
00:14:23,153 --> 00:14:25,281
We're also being noticed
in other countries.

232
00:14:25,364 --> 00:14:27,658
So, what if

233
00:14:27,741 --> 00:14:31,495
we offer LoveList for global franchising?

234
00:14:31,579 --> 00:14:33,205
- [TONI] Ooh!
- [CHARM] Oh, I like that!

235
00:14:33,289 --> 00:14:34,623
I like that, I love it!

236
00:14:34,707 --> 00:14:37,042
Universe, let's manifest it!

237
00:14:37,126 --> 00:14:40,170
- [MARJ] Yes, let's get it!
- [CHARM, TONI GIGGLING]

238
00:14:40,254 --> 00:14:42,590
- Congratulations, girls.
- [CHARM] Congrats, girls!

239
00:14:42,673 --> 00:14:45,259
- Congrats! Cheers!
- Cheers!

240
00:14:45,342 --> 00:14:48,262
[GENTLE MUSIC PLAYING]

241
00:14:48,345 --> 00:14:49,847
Okay, sure.

242
00:14:49,930 --> 00:14:52,224
[INDISTINCT SOCIAL CHATTER]

243
00:14:52,308 --> 00:14:57,688
[GENTLE MUSIC CONTINUES]

244
00:14:59,565 --> 00:15:01,775
- Congratulations!
- Thank you! Good night!

245
00:15:01,859 --> 00:15:03,277
Dude, congrats!

246
00:15:03,360 --> 00:15:04,403
Thank you!

247
00:15:04,486 --> 00:15:06,780
For the award and for Caloy's arrest.

248
00:15:06,864 --> 00:15:07,948
- Oh, yes.
- As we speak,

249
00:15:08,032 --> 00:15:11,035
I believe Bea has already been
taken to the police station.

250
00:15:11,118 --> 00:15:12,912
- Mm.
- Thank God!

251
00:15:12,995 --> 00:15:16,206
Oh! You can use my room, okay?

252
00:15:16,290 --> 00:15:19,001
Once I take off my makeup,
I'm heading home, so it's yours.

253
00:15:19,084 --> 00:15:20,419
No, it's okay.

254
00:15:20,502 --> 00:15:22,338
- Why?
- Come on, let's celebrate.

255
00:15:22,421 --> 00:15:23,422
Let's go!

256
00:15:23,505 --> 00:15:24,757
Ma'am, you see?

257
00:15:24,840 --> 00:15:26,675
I had nothing to do with him!

258
00:15:26,759 --> 00:15:27,635
[BEA WHIMPERS]

259
00:15:27,718 --> 00:15:30,763
He's totally out of his mind.
He's obsessed with me.

260
00:15:30,846 --> 00:15:34,308
For him to say everything he did
was for me?!

261
00:15:35,809 --> 00:15:37,061
Is that really so?

262
00:15:37,144 --> 00:15:40,022
[TENSE MUSIC PLAYING]

263
00:15:40,105 --> 00:15:41,690
Yes, it was for me!

264
00:15:41,774 --> 00:15:43,859
It was for me,
but I never told him to do anything!

265
00:15:43,943 --> 00:15:47,196
I never asked him to do anything
because I don't even know him!

266
00:15:47,279 --> 00:15:50,115
Ma'am, please. I'm innocent.

267
00:15:50,199 --> 00:15:51,575
Don't lock me up!

268
00:15:51,659 --> 00:15:53,160
Please, I'm begging you.

269
00:15:53,243 --> 00:15:56,830
Ma'am, I don't want to go to jail.
I don't want to go to jail!

270
00:15:56,914 --> 00:15:59,333
Please believe me.

271
00:15:59,416 --> 00:16:01,001
Ma'am, I don't know him.

272
00:16:01,085 --> 00:16:04,129
I had nothing to do with this.
I never told him to do anything. Please!

273
00:16:06,173 --> 00:16:10,135
Dude, cheers to you
and to your genius plan.

274
00:16:10,219 --> 00:16:11,345
Genius!

275
00:16:11,428 --> 00:16:12,721
Congrats to us!

276
00:16:12,805 --> 00:16:14,056
- Thank you.
- [JORDAN] And now…

277
00:16:14,807 --> 00:16:17,643
Caloy's behind bars.

278
00:16:17,726 --> 00:16:19,144
One problem solved.

279
00:16:19,228 --> 00:16:20,604
Cheers.

280
00:16:20,688 --> 00:16:22,314
And cheers to your acting too.

281
00:16:22,398 --> 00:16:24,984
Because you're the best actor.

282
00:16:25,067 --> 00:16:28,112
You really nailed it earlier.

283
00:16:28,195 --> 00:16:29,989
Of course. You know how talented I am.

284
00:16:30,072 --> 00:16:32,116
Mm! You really are!

285
00:16:32,199 --> 00:16:33,117
Did you see earlier?

286
00:16:33,200 --> 00:16:36,537
After your performance,
so many women came up to you.

287
00:16:36,620 --> 00:16:38,414
They were handing you their calling cards.

288
00:16:38,497 --> 00:16:40,833
I don't know if those were offers
for gigs or dates.

289
00:16:40,916 --> 00:16:41,875
Which were they?

290
00:16:42,835 --> 00:16:44,420
Both. Duh!

291
00:16:44,503 --> 00:16:48,215
Wow, you really are so talented!

292
00:16:48,298 --> 00:16:49,633
- Cheers to that.
- [GLASSES CLINK]

293
00:16:49,717 --> 00:16:51,468
[BILLY CHUCKLES]

294
00:16:51,552 --> 00:16:53,095
[WOMAN SINGING IN BACKGROUND]

295
00:16:53,178 --> 00:16:57,891
[PEOPLE APPLAUDING]

296
00:16:57,975 --> 00:16:59,309
Oh, it's your turn. Do you want to--

297
00:16:59,393 --> 00:17:00,602
You should perform.

298
00:17:00,686 --> 00:17:02,438
- Let's both do it.
- They're done.

299
00:17:02,521 --> 00:17:03,480
Wanna do it?

300
00:17:04,106 --> 00:17:05,315
Thank you.

301
00:17:05,399 --> 00:17:07,735
[CROWD CLAPPING]

302
00:17:07,818 --> 00:17:14,825
[SLOW MUSIC PLAYING IN SPEAKERS]

303
00:17:24,168 --> 00:17:30,466
[SOFT MUSIC PLAYING]

304
00:17:36,388 --> 00:17:42,644
["ABELYANA" BY MAKI PLAYING]

305
00:17:58,535 --> 00:18:04,875
["ABELYANA" CONTINUES]

306
00:18:20,474 --> 00:18:26,563
["ABELYANA" CONTINUES]

307
00:18:41,245 --> 00:18:46,500
["ABELYANA" CONTINUES]

308
00:19:03,433 --> 00:19:06,687
["ABELYANA" CONTINUES, FADES]

309
00:19:06,770 --> 00:19:10,274
<i>I'm sure your sister</i>
<i>will like Sir Eric too.</i>

310
00:19:10,357 --> 00:19:11,942
<i>I think you and Sir Eric</i>
<i>make a better couple</i>

311
00:19:12,025 --> 00:19:13,443
<i>than you and Coach Brandon.</i>

312
00:19:13,527 --> 00:19:14,778
<i>What are you talking about?</i>

313
00:19:14,862 --> 00:19:17,030
<i>You're too young to be thinking</i>
<i>about things like that.</i>

314
00:19:17,114 --> 00:19:19,825
<i>It's way past your 10-day deadline</i>
<i>with Boss Zandro.</i>

315
00:19:19,908 --> 00:19:21,118
<i>I'll pay in full</i>

316
00:19:21,201 --> 00:19:22,578
<i>next month.</i>

317
00:19:22,661 --> 00:19:24,454
[THUG] <i>You think I was just</i>
<i>bluffing with my threat?</i>

318
00:19:24,538 --> 00:19:26,832
[NURSE] <i>You're listed as</i>
<i>an emergency contact.</i>

319
00:19:26,915 --> 00:19:28,292
<i>Emergency contact for whom?</i>

320
00:19:28,375 --> 00:19:30,002
<i>For patient Enrico Dominguez.</i>

321
00:19:30,627 --> 00:19:32,337
<i>Your father owes my boss.</i>

322
00:19:32,421 --> 00:19:35,382
<i>It's his debt, not mine.</i>

323
00:19:35,465 --> 00:19:36,717
<i>- That's your problem.</i>
<i>- Jordan!</i>

324
00:19:36,800 --> 00:19:38,343
<i>My friend has nothing</i>
<i>to do with it, okay?</i>

325
00:19:39,553 --> 00:19:41,305
<i>Gosh, what would I do</i>

326
00:19:41,388 --> 00:19:44,183
<i>if I didn't have</i>
<i>my ridiculously cocky best friend?</i>

327
00:19:44,266 --> 00:19:45,517
<i>All he's missing</i>
<i>is a girlfriend.</i>

328
00:19:45,601 --> 00:19:47,227
<i>We'll find one for him.</i>

329
00:19:47,311 --> 00:19:54,318
["ABELYANA" BY MAKI PLAYING]
